WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.530
Flick a switch, and a fan
starts spinning straight away.

2
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.890
There's no engine inside.

3
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:11.260
No fuel. Just a coil of wire, a couple
of magnets, and an electric current.

4
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:14.917
So what is actually
pushing the blades round?

5
00:00:14.967 --> 00:00:17.777
Before we explain anything,
make a prediction.

6
00:00:17.827 --> 00:00:18.837
Lock it in.

7
00:00:18.887 --> 00:00:20.537
Then test it in the model.
